  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop at Bioeconomy Summit 2024, Nairobi Kenya, Oct 23/24</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For improvement of the thematic network, competence and profile of IET/AGR/AIB, active participation at the first global bioeconomy summit to be held in Africa, in October 2024, is intended. Moreover facilitation of a workshop / expert group meeting, on Oct 23/24 2024. The participation in the event is intended to leverage synergies with national, regional, international stakeholders from academia/research, industry, civil society, governments and international agencies.</narrative>
  </description>
